WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.630
Thank you for listening, and for telling us what could be better.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:14.214
Mutable Dreams one point three brings new textures and more room to explore.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:29.195
Explore soft keys, rounded bass, reeds and wooden resonances.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:37.089
Each new Biome brings a different ensemble, with space for the sounds to breathe.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:52.201
Five original lo-fi kits add forty drum and texture samples.

00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:59.593
Play one kit alongside three synth tracks, or return to six synth tracks.

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:15.536
New sequence directions and four more pattern generators reshape your melodies.

00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:23.672
Longer chord journeys and nearby roots bring gentle changes, while your own notes stay yours.

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:38.558
Two independent L F Os on every synth track add slow movement.

00:01:38.558 --> 00:01:47.616
Let one shape the colour, while the other moves the panorama, the effect sends, or a soft swell.

00:01:56.625 --> 00:02:01.861
An accidental Biome change now asks before replacing your edits.

00:02:01.861 --> 00:02:08.978
Larger type and tiny living backgrounds make the instrument easier to read and explore.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.335
Your feedback keeps this instrument growing.

00:02:22.335 --> 00:02:27.556
These sounds were recorded directly from the F M one.

00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:31.793
Find a Biome, change it, and make it yours.
